--- A. the window, and a quiet upstream: both events are handed out
 upstream_errors_max | upstream_errors_window 
---------------------+------------------------
                   3 | 00:10:00

                                                                   handed_out                                                                   | errors 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+--------
 [{"id": "H1", "url": "https://www.axs.com/events/H1", "every_min": 15}, {"id": "H2", "url": "https://www.axs.com/events/H2", "every_min": 30}] | 0

--- B. eight HTTP 502s in a row INSIDE the window: the breaker trips and nothing is handed out
                                      held                                       
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 {"events": [], "hold_s": 60, "errors_window": "00:10:00", "upstream_errors": 8}

--- C. the hold does NOT depend on a new read to clear: age those failures past the window and it lifts
                                                                handed_out_again                                                                | errors_now 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+------------
 [{"id": "H1", "url": "https://www.axs.com/events/H1", "every_min": 15}, {"id": "H2", "url": "https://www.axs.com/events/H2", "every_min": 30}] | 0

--- D. a still-broken upstream re-trips it: three fresh failures are enough
                                   held_again                                    
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 {"events": [], "hold_s": 60, "errors_window": "00:10:00", "upstream_errors": 3}

--- E. a recovered upstream clears it at once: the newest read inside the window is not a failure
                                                           handed_out_after_recovery                                                            | errors_still_counted 
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+----------------------
 [{"id": "H1", "url": "https://www.axs.com/events/H1", "every_min": 15}, {"id": "H2", "url": "https://www.axs.com/events/H2", "every_min": 30}] | 3

--- F. the window is bounded: it cannot be set to nothing, nor to a whole day
